B.Yk=new A.aO(B.H,B.a9,16,"C and Comma: Middle Fingers Down","Reach down with your middle fingers to C (left) and comma (right).","m,m ,, ,,l ,, ,c ,,, ccw ,, dc m, pcp cc pc p, ccj i,, ,,, ci cat, cut, cup, cry, cure, circle, clock, check, cloud, face, price, voice, music, place,",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","c,","Left middle: C \xb7 Right middle: , (comma)","C is below D and the comma is below K.")
