B.Ug=new A.eX("Cities at Night","When the sun sets, a city changes completely. Office buildings that were full of noise and movement fall quiet, while restaurants and markets nearby begin to fill with people. The streets take on a different rhythm, calmer in some corners and livelier in others.",B.d5)
